Content sources
---------------

Module descriptions, parameter notes and pitfalls were compiled from public
tool documentation, published papers and general domain practice, and were
then edited for this knowledge base. Where a value or version could not be
verified, the text says so; the authoritative source is always the tool's
official documentation.

